      "notes": "Adversarial control-evaluation scenario added 2026-05-13. Designed by construction to defeat the rule detector (which never fires on S16, as the paraphrased commands lack the trigger phrases the rule matches on) so the LLM-detector recall on S16 measures how well the trained model generalises beyond literal keywords. Rule recall on S16 is the headline finding of \u00a77."
